.TH MU2EDAQ_SHIFTER_TOOLS 3 "2026-09-10" "mu2edaq-shifter-tools" "Library Functions"
.SH NAME
mu2edaq_shifter_tools \- Python API for the Mu2e DAQ shifter tools
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B import mu2edaq_shifter_tools
.B from mu2edaq_shifter_tools import config
.B from mu2edaq_shifter_tools.config import Operations
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
The
.B mu2edaq_shifter_tools
package holds the Python half of the toolkit. Every command line entry
point is a thin
.BR click (3)
wrapper over importable functions, so the same logic is available to
other Mu2e software without shelling out.
.PP
The package lives under \fIsrc/\fR and is installed from
\fIpyproject.toml\fR. It requires Python 3.9 or newer and depends only
on \fBPyYAML\fR and \fBclick\fR; \fBPyQt5\fR is an optional extra used
by one flag of one command.
.SH MODULES
.TP
.B mu2edaq_shifter_tools.config
Configuration discovery, loading and precedence, plus the
\fBOperations\fR accessor class over the operations YAML. This is the
module other code is most likely to want. See
.BR mu2edaq_shifter_tools_config (3).
.TP
.B mu2edaq_shifter_tools.read_config
Implements
.BR daq-read-config (1).
\fBVERBS\fR maps every command verb to its description and is the
single source of truth for that list.
.TP
.B mu2edaq_shifter_tools.open_tunnels
Implements
.BR daq-open-tunnels (1).
Useful pieces:
\fBdefault_base_port()\fR,
\fBssh_command(tunnel, base_port, username)\fR,
\fBread_state(path)\fR and \fBwrite_state(path, records)\fR,
\fBprocess_alive(pid)\fR.
.TP
.B mu2edaq_shifter_tools.cluster_cp
Implements
.BR daq-cluster-cp (1).
\fBload_nodes(path)\fR returns the node inventory and
\fBselect_hosts(nodes, groups, want_all)\fR resolves group flags to a
de-duplicated, stably ordered host list.
.TP
.B mu2edaq_shifter_tools.ls2json
Implements
.BR daq-ls2json (1).
\fBlisting(directories, include_dirs=False)\fR returns the structure
that the command serialises.
.TP
.B mu2edaq_shifter_tools.install_daq_tools
Implements
.BR daq-install-tools (1).
\fBbuild_version_string(version)\fR renders a structured version, and
\fBrelease_paths(config)\fR expands \fBinstall_path\fR into concrete
directories.
.SH ATTRIBUTES
.TP
.B __version__
The package version, kept in step with \fIpyproject.toml\fR and the
CMake project version.
.SH EXAMPLES
Read the operations configuration and report every gateway port:
.PP
.RS
.nf
from mu2edaq_shifter_tools.config import Operations

ops = Operations.load()
for partition in ops.partitions():
    for env in ops.active_environments(partition):
        print(partition, env, ops.gateway_port(partition, env))
.fi
.RE
.PP
Resolve the cluster host list without copying anything:
.PP
.RS
.nf
from mu2edaq_shifter_tools import cluster_cp

nodes = cluster_cp.load_nodes()
hosts = cluster_cp.select_hosts(nodes, ["trk", "calo"], False)
.fi
.RE
